<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Coles sees similar H2 profit growth.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Coles sees similar H2 profit growth.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian retail group Coles Myer Ltd said on Thursday it expected growth in net profit for the second half of the 1996/97 financial year to be similar to the rate achieved in the first half.</p>
<p>Coles earlier reported a first half net profit of A$273.6 million, up from A$194.5 million, but boosted by an abnormal gain of A$44.6 million.</p>
</text>
